Description: private control plane for a VPN gateway
 SnarkyCtl provides a read-only HTTPS dashboard, command-line diagnostics,
 and a narrowly scoped privileged control daemon for a VPN gateway.
 .
 The initial package targets Ubuntu 24.04 on amd64. A separately installed
 and configured upstream VPN provider is required for provider operations.
